{"ref":"BDB, חֹבֵל","hw":"חֹבֵל","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חֹבֵל</span></big>  <strong>n.m. sailor (</strong>denom. from <span dir=\"rtl\">חֶבֶל</span>; i.e. <em>rope</em>-puller<strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">חֹבְלֵי הַיָּם</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 27:29\" href=\"/Ezekiel.27.29\">Ez 27:29</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חֹבְלָ֑יִךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 27:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.27.8\">Ez 27:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 27:27\" href=\"/Ezekiel.27.27\">27</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 27:28\" href=\"/Ezekiel.27.28\">28</a>; coll. <span dir=\"rtl\">רַב הַחֹבֵל</span> i.e. the captain <a data-ref=\"Jonah 1:6\" href=\"/Jonah.1.6\">Jon 1:6</a>.","next":"BDB, חֹבְלִים","prev":"BDB, חִבֵּל"}